  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups farfalle pasta",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "0.5 cup grated Parmesan cheese",
    "1 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1 teaspoon Italian seasoning",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dX7OGvGjUBlBtPAHhLQr-DF7MqQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-279396-air-fryer-pasta-chips-DDMFS-4x3-step-01-102af2d24e32420ca0bb737d0e2eff84.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279396/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil; add pasta and cook, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 8 minutes. Drain, but do not rinse. Let sit for 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rpMSRfuzh9DNrN4Y4CuRgzrQZ30=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-279396-air-fryer-pasta-chips-DDMFS-4x3-step-02-e816ca139f4945d5ac4fc94db4eb6b05.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279396/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat an air fryer to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Meanwhile, transfer pasta to a large bowl and drizzle with olive oil; stir in Parmesan cheese, garlic powder, Italian seasoning, and salt until evenly combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WHbnyZTl5MxrDGjRBc31R3GWXwA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-279396-air-fryer-pasta-chips-DDMFS-4x3-step-03-4d8d81449d9b494a91e7ddcacf6680ee.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279396/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange 1/4 of the pasta in a single layer in the air fryer basket.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8DDwXDw0b_5YVl1qFnB815m_V8A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-279396-air-fryer-pasta-chips-DDMFS-4x3-step-04-81884ce36e4a476e9f0a18dac8c45806.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279396/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook in the preheated air fryer for 5 minutes; flip and cook 2 to 3 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-SfPMSo_ApAq9pss1pNPEejfso4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-279396-air-fryer-pasta-chips-DDMFS-4x3-step-05-d6f4211c01bb40f3af88d99100a9bc04.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279396/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate and break apart any pasta chips that have stuck together; let cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0wH4y4r-h6dmJiTuxJdRDOMf3_o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-279396-air-fryer-pasta-chips-DDMFS-4x3-step-06-04a7f8cb70b34c48a288cb4e7aac4e4e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279396/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Repeat with remaining pasta. Serve with your choice of dip and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vAfAk68Ym_4_772jKtBPq168W_M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-279396-air-fryer-pasta-chips-DDMFS-4x3-hero-2e428b2aae4a470890323f545c128afb.jpg"
